---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="access" class="bg-canvas px-gutter py-section">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="Access"
      title="代々木上原駅から、歩いて5分。"
      description="北口を出て住宅街へ。静かな通りに面した1階という想定の、架空店舗です。"
    />

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-16">
      <dl class="border-b border-strong">
        <div class="border-t border-strong py-6">
          <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-label text-accent">住所</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 font-heading text-base leading-relaxed text-primary">
            〒151-0064<br />東京都渋谷区上原1丁目26-5<br />サンプルビル 1F
          </dd>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">デモサイトのため架空の住所です。</dd>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-strong py-6">
          <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-label text-accent">電車でのアクセス</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-secondary">
            小田急線・千代田線「代々木上原駅」北口から徒歩5分
          </dd>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">お近くにコインパーキングあり</dd>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-strong py-6">
          <dt class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-label text-accent">お問い合わせ</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 font-brand text-xl font-semibold text-primary">03-XXXX-XXXX</dd>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">営業時間内にお気軽にどうぞ（デモ用番号）</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-strong bg-subtle shadow-md">
        <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 600 450" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="600" height="450" fill="#EDE4D0"/>
          <g stroke="#A98B70" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.55">
            <path d="M0 78H600M0 158H600M0 238H600M0 318H600M0 398H600"/>
            <path d="M86 0V450M186 0V450M286 0V450M386 0V450M486 0V450"/>
          </g>
          <g stroke="#6B4027" stroke-width="4" fill="none" opacity="0.35">
            <path d="M-30 300C120 240 220 290 640 110"/>
            <path d="M350 -30C325 110 365 260 300 480"/>
          </g>
          <g fill="#D7C6B2">
            <rect x="105" y="95" width="62" height="44" rx="4"/>
            <rect x="205" y="174" width="62" height="44" rx="4"/>
            <rect x="405" y="254" width="62" height="44" rx="4"/>
            <rect x="505" y="95" width="62" height="124" rx="4"/>
            <rect x="105" y="334" width="162" height="44" rx="4"/>
          </g>
          <circle cx="300" cy="225" r="28" fill="#9B5C25" opacity="0.18"/>
          <circle cx="300" cy="225" r="14" fill="#9B5C25"/>
          <circle cx="300" cy="225" r="5" fill="#1E0F07"/>
        </svg>

        <div class="absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-4 py-3 text-sm text-inverse shadow-md">
          <strong>Café Ouka — 代々木上原</strong>
          <span class="text-xs text-accent-soft">デモ用地図</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
